  "releaseNotes": "See https://github.com/JefferyLeo/boostgrid/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md for the full per-version log. v2.5.0 introduces element pooling under virtual scroll (data <tr>s are recycled in place on every scroll tick instead of rebuilt — expected 5–10× scroll speed-up) and a new public scrollToRow(index) method for programmatic jump-scroll. Mid-edit values are now committed silently before a row is recycled. Bundle 16.25 KB brotli, ceiling 18 KB.",
